      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can explain gender identity to your 7-year-old by sharing that some people feel their inside is a boy, while others feel like a girl or something different, regardless of their body. Emphasize that pronouns are just words people use to refer to themselves, and the important thing is to respect how each person introduces themselves. Reassure your child that it is okay to ask questions and that listening to their own feelings is the best way to understand these differences.",
